    design: ['keep the dimensioning scheme consistent throughout the drawing and development', 'use bend radii that suit material ductility and tooling capacity', 'locate holes away from bend zones or form them with a defined sequence', 'include trim, weld shrinkage and rolling allowance where applicable', 'validate new material/tool combinations with a representative first article'],
