    warning: ['a high service factor does not correct an excessive overhung belt load', 'wrong oil viscosity can cause wear, heat or poor low-temperature starting', 'gearbox housing flexibility or soft foot can disturb alignment', 'repeated torque reversals can damage keys, couplings and gear teeth even at modest average power'],
    use: 'conveyors, mixers, crushers, hoists, fans, pumps, extruders and material-handling machinery',
